WEBVTT

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:06.450
All right!

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:09.220
What do you think, Yusei?  
Don't I look just like Luca?

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:11.770
No wonder you're twins.  I can't 
tell the difference at all.

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:13.260
Right?

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.320
I don't act like that.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.990
Well well...

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:20.520
I'll act fine, so don't worry.

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:23.360
So shall we go, Yusei?

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.070
Lua, you shouldn't wear makeup.

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:30.090
You think?

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.700
Yusei, in this Fortune Cup…

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:39.680
I have no doubt that 
something's up.  Be careful.

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:06.390
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:01:06.470 --> 00:01:11.390
That's deeply engraved into us

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:19.930
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:25.930
Break through even further

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:31.400
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:38.550
There's always only one truth

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:42.360
So feel the voice of your heart

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:47.180
With your unwavering emotions

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:53.280
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:28.360
Duel of Fortune Cup BeginsAttack from 
the Sky!  Flying Fortress SKYFIRE

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:31.890
Everybody listen!

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:36.460
Duel of Fortune Cup is finally starting!

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:40.080
Yes!  Yes!  Yes!

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:41.090
Yay!

00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:50.310
Red Dragon Archfiend has appeared!

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:54.990
And the sound of this D-Wheel must mean...

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:13.200
Master Atlas!

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:17.060
There's only one King, and it's me!

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:19.660
Who's going to duel me?

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:26.440
The duelists who received the lucky tickets for a 
chance at a dream match against the King are here!

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:31.940
It's starting!  Whoa, Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:03:56.990 --> 00:03:59.460
Hey, there's a guy with a marker!

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:01.130
You're right.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:04.910
If they're going to choose someone like 
that, then I wish they could have chosen one of us.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:07.860
He probably stole someone's invitation.

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:12.780
Yusei…

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:14.320
Don't worry.

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:25.380
Everyone!

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:28.970
My name is Bommer.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:33.800
As one of the duelists standing here, 
I want to ask what you're seeing.

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:39.630
This man is a duelist chosen in 
the same manner as the rest of us!

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:45.580
Whether you have a marker or not, as long 
as you have cards, we're all the same.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:48.980
As long as you're standing here, 
there's nothing to be ashamed of.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:52.760
If you're going to stare at him 
through stupid rose-colored glasses,

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:55.360
then your words do nothing 
but incite violence!

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:17.450
Thank you.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:23.460
Thank you for your heartfelt words, Bommer.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:29.280
What I have prepared here in this 
arena is exactly what you said.

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:34.790
I am Rex Godwin, the person in charge of Neo 
Domino City's Public Maintenance Department.

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:42.760
To thank everyone for their public 
maintenance, I organized this great duel festival.

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:46.750
Differences in status nor wealth 
do not matter for duelists.

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:49.300
This is true equality.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:56.900
Here are the matchups for the first round!

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:04.370
I'm in the very first duel!  Hooray!

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:08.950
I'm gonna make it!

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:15.880
All preparations have been completed.

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:19.710
It's only a matter of time 
until the Signers gather.

00:06:21.550 --> 00:06:23.750
Good morning!

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:29.950
I've also completed all my preparations.  
All that's left is for the duels to take place!

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:34.170
The reactions from the Signers will 
pass through the gigantic Moment!

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:39.300
Here's my greatest creation.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:45.550
I call it the D-Sensor.  It's a detector.

00:06:46.140 --> 00:06:48.490
Sensors have been placed around the stadium.

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:51.590
Signers create more powerful 
reactions when they duel,

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:54.590
and we'll be able to detect 
even the smallest signal.

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:56.610
I'm counting on you.

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:58.280
Leave it to me.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:07.720
Yusei, let's meet in the finals!

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:11.440
I remember what you told me, Yusei.

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:14.820
I won't duel selfishly anymore!

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:18.060
If you believe in your 
cards, they'll answer you.

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:19.870
Right.  Here I go!

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:29.890
Allow me to introduce the 
duelists in the first matchup.

00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:34.810
I'll bet kids around the 
world are jealous of her.

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:38.160
The girl is the youngest 
competitor in the tournament.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:41.850
The dueling angel who has come 
down from the heavens, Miss Luca!

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:45.420
Everyone's looking at me.  I feel so good!

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:52.250
And facing her is the man who gave the 
moving speech, Bommer the Black Storm!

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:56.180
They will battle in a standing 
duel.  First, shake hands!

00:07:57.670 --> 00:08:01.870
I was really moved by your speech, Mister.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:05.830
It's true that no duelist is a bad person.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:10.170
I heard that you were a girl, 
but it looks like you're a boy.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:16.760
People often say that I'm boyish, 
but I'm actually a girl.  See?

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:19.280
I do not act like that.

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:22.180
It's time for the duel!

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:25.530
Both players, activate your Duel Disks!

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:28.140
Duel!

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:31.010
My turn.  I draw!

00:08:31.430 --> 00:08:34.120
From my hand, I activate Star Blast!

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:36.750
That's fine.  Keep activating things!

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:43.260
With this card, by paying 500 life points, I 
can lower the Level of a chosen monster by one.

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:45.790
You shaved off your own life points?

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:50.650
I lower the Level of my Level 5 monster 
Summon Reactor・SK in my hand by one.

00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:53.550
Then I summon it in attack position!

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:57.830
He already has a monster 
with 2000 attack points!

00:08:57.830 --> 00:09:02.130
Due to the effect of Star Blast, Summon 
Reactor's Level is lowered to four,

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:03.760
so I can Normal Summon it.

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:06.280
I set one card and end my turn!

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:08.740
A monster with 2000 attack 
points is problematic,

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:11.440
but all I have to do is believe 
in my cards and face him!

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:14.200
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:16.540
I already got it!

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:20.450
I summon Morphtronic Celfon 
in attack position!

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:35.840
Mister, I'll show you how 
great my Morphtronic Deck is!

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:41.370
Before that, I'm going to activate 
Summon Reactor's monster effect.

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:48.740
Summon Reactor responds when the opponent 
summons a monster.  You take 800 points of damage.

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:03.890
He's already on the offensive.

00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:09.290
Not bad, Mister.

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:12.580
But my Morphtronic Deck also won't lose.

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:16.890
That's right.  Get more fired 
up.  Point your fangs at me!

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:22.600
Then like you said, why don't you introduce 
me to the power of your Morphtronics?

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:26.090
I would have done that 
even if you didn't ask!

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:30.840
Lua has no intention of 
trying to act like me.

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:36.190
Celfon's monster effect.  Dial on!

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:39.210
When Celfon is in attack position, 
I flip over the same number of cards

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:41.610
in my deck as the number 
that appears on the dial.

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:46.580
If the final card is a Level 4-or-below 
Morphtronic monster, I can Special Summon it!

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:49.350
All right, it's two!

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:52.430
The second card is…

00:10:52.990 --> 00:10:58.040
I got it!  I Special Summon Morphtronic 
Boomboxen in defense position!

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:02.980
I set one card and end my turn!

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:08.350
With the trap card Morphtransition, 
even if he destroys

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:11.650
one of my monsters on his turn, 
I'll still have one remaining.

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:16.210
If that's the case, I'll 
be able to summon this!

00:11:33.740 --> 00:11:36.120
There's still no reaction.

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:39.160
I'll do a stronger scan.

00:11:42.140 --> 00:11:43.230
What's wrong?

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:45.040
It's just…

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:47.140
My turn.

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:48.710
I draw!

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:53.620
From my hand, I summon Trap 
Reactor・Y FI in attack position!

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:56.410
Here I go.

00:11:56.410 --> 00:12:00.240
Battle!  Trap Reactor attacks Celfon!

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:04.900
I was waiting for that!  I flip over 
my trap card Morphtransition!  Ta-daa!

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:10.190
Due to its effect, Celfon switches to defense 
position, and your monster's attack is negated.

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:15.470
It looks like you have some skill.  However, 
I use Trap Reactor's monster effect.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:22.550
Trap Reactor responds to your trap, 
and you take 800 points of damage.

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:23.580
Go!

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:31.590
He has a tough dueling style.

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:33.880
He strings Lua along so that he 
can take away his life points.

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:37.270
He puts lots of emotional pressure on Lua.

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:41.630
You haven't beaten me  yet!

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:43.650
That's right.  Get fired up.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:46.130
Your dueling skills are supposed 
to be better than this.

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:49.620
Defeat me with the power of the dragon!

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:53.440
Nothing's happening.

00:12:55.010 --> 00:12:59.020
I'm not done yet.  Let's battle again!

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:00.190
Bring it!

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:04.660
Summon Reactor attacks 
Boomboxen!  Summon React!

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:11.910
The attack on Boomboxen wasn't successful!  
Summon Reactor's attack was negated!

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:17.950
When Boomboxen is in defense position, 
it can negate a battle once a turn!

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:20.670
Then I activate the trap card Damage Summon.

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:24.610
When my monster fails 
to destroy your monster,

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:29.110
I can Special Summon a Level 4-or-below 
monster from my hand by paying 800 life points.

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:32.200
He got rid of his own life points 
again in order to Special Summon?

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:37.510
From my hand, I Special Summon Spell 
Reactor・RE in attack position!

00:13:40.890 --> 00:13:42.540
It's time for a third battle.

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:47.370
Spell Reactor attacks Boomboxen!  Flame Aid!

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:49.470
Boomboxen!

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:52.050
I set one card and end my turn.

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:54.440
He finally ends his turn.

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:57.200
But I was able to keep Celfon alive.

00:13:57.200 --> 00:14:00.490
As long as I have this, I 
can summon Gadget Hauler.

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:02.820
I'll turn the tables!

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:07.290
He's only dreaming about 
his own combos again.

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:12.950
You seem to be having plenty of fun, but 
don't you know that you're in trouble?

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:17.230
The three monsters in the Reactor 
series have gathered on my field.

00:14:17.230 --> 00:14:21.910
You took direct damage due to the monster 
effects of Summon Reactor and Trap Reactor.

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:25.650
That means Spell Reactor has 
a similar monster effect.

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:27.380
You couldn't anticipate that?

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:32.750
I see!  If I use a spell, I'll 
take damage from Spell Reactor.

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:37.170
With the other two, I'll take damage 
if I summon or activate a trap.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:38.630
This is bad!

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:44.340
That's right.  In a duel, you 
need summons, traps and spells.

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:46.320
You'll have to keep using them.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:49.210
But if you do so, you'll 
continue to lose life points.

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:55.640
In other words, you'll lose to your own 
dueling even if I don't do anything!

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:00.240
This is bad.

00:15:00.690 --> 00:15:03.990
Bommer, you do good work.

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:06.270
I'm surprised that there's no signal.

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:10.180
We have already confirmed in our 
investigations that the girl has power.

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:13.850
The link between that power and 
the Signer's power is the issue.

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:15.920
Focus on that.

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:19.460
I already know that.  I 
have something to report.

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:22.780
I've detected a faint signal from the stands.

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:25.520
The stands?  Not the field?

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:28.360
It's unusual, but…

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:31.320
Are you okay?  Do you want 
to go the medical center?

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:34.030
No, I'm not stick.  It's...

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:38.630
Every time I do something, 
I lose 800 life points?

00:15:39.130 --> 00:15:41.820
What would Yusei do in this situation?

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:44.930
If I was Yusei…

00:15:44.930 --> 00:15:46.920
I would believe in my cards!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:49.350
After all this, you're 
finally getting fired up!

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:51.820
That's fine!  Show your fangs!

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:54.770
I'll also believe in my cards.

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:58.100
I will finish things on 
the next turn!  My turn!

00:15:58.320 --> 00:16:05.050
I draw!  Celfon's monster effect!  Dial on!

00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:06.650
When Celfon is in defense position,

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:08.950
I can look at the same number 
of cards from the top of my deck

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:10.950
as the number that was dialed 
and then put them back.

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:13.150
The number is three!

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:17.400
The Morphtronic series will 
continue.  I still have a chance!

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:20.820
I switch Celfon to attack position.

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:26.290
Dial on!

00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:31.770
In order to win, I have to summon 
Morphtronic Datatron.  I need it to land on number one!

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:33.740
All right!  Here it comes!

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:38.850
I Special Summon Morphtronic 
Datatron in attack position!

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:50.070
Are you really okay?

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:51.110
Yeah…

00:16:51.850 --> 00:16:55.420
It's hard to explain, but the 
inside of my head feels foggy.

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:58.210
Like I thought!  A wonderful signal!

00:16:58.220 --> 00:17:01.320
I activate Summon Reactor's monster effect.

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:04.370
You take 800 points of damage!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:08.350
Summon Reactor's monster effect strikes Luca!

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:12.040
The countdown to defeat begins!

00:17:12.450 --> 00:17:13.750
Here I go!

00:17:13.770 --> 00:17:20.670
With Datatron, by releasing one monster on 
my field, you take 600 points of damage!

00:17:21.590 --> 00:17:23.420
I release Celfon!

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:29.000
How's that!  It worked!

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:34.170
Next, I release Datatron to 
Advance Summon Gadget Hauler!

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:45.210
Even if I summon this, I don't take damage!

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:49.460
Summon Reactor's monster effect 
only works once a turn, right?

00:17:50.640 --> 00:17:53.350
The monster effect can only be used once.

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:55.270
He can't let his guard down yet.

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:58.670
Bommer is very skilled.

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:03.720
I'm going to keep going!  From my 
hand, I release Morphtronic Magnen.

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:11.450
Gadget Hauler gains 800 attack points whenever a 
Morphtronic monster in my hand is sent to the graveyard!

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:14.720
Nice.  Keep getting fired up and attack me!

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:18.420
From my hand, I activate the spell 
card Factory of 100 Machines!

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:23.920
With Factory of 100 Machines, all Morphtronic 
monsters in the graveyard are removed from play!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.580
What a surprising move!

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:27.000
Go!

00:18:27.010 --> 00:18:32.140
Four Morphtronic monsters 
entered Gadget Hauler!

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:37.980
For every Machine-Type monster, 
it gains 200 attack points!

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:40.750
It has 2900 attack points!

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:46.620
The activation of that spell card 
brought you one step closer to defeat.

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.020
Spell Reactor's monster effect activates.

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:52.210
800 points of damage!

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:59.210
Show me the soul that risks everything in 
a duel!  Come at me with all your power!

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:02.830
I survived this far.  I'm going 
to give everything I have!

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:08.160
Battle!  Gadget Hauler, 
attack Trap Reactor・Y FI!

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:11.350
Gadgeting Cannon, fire!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:14.850
All right!

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:16.370
Do your best, little girl!

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:20.930
Bommer has 2100 life points.  If that 
worked, it's a humongous comeback!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:21.980
Lua.

00:19:21.980 --> 00:19:24.560
I found you!

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:30.170
Did I do it?

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:39.130
Even though you're small, you 
have the pride of a warrior.

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:42.000
That attack was excellent!

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:46.040
Does that mean Gadgeting Cannon worked?

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:48.670
The trap card Delta Reactor.

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:50.180
A set card!

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:53.960
Delta Reactor activates 
by sending Summon Reactor,

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:58.300
Trap Reactor and Spell 
Reactor to the graveyard.

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:02.000
I Special Summon Flying Fortress SKY FIRE!

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:10.390
The trap card of destiny activated!  
An incredible monster has appeared!

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:13.230
Luca will definitely be defeated!

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:17.650
Flying Fortress SKY FIRE's 
monster effect activates!

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:23.340
By sending one card in my hand to my 
graveyard, one card on your field is destroyed!

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:24.650
Death Drop!

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:32.800
Oh no!

00:20:32.890 --> 00:20:34.040
Battle!

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:37.410
Attack him directly.  Death Air Raid!

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:53.640
There's a winner!  Bommer is 
going to the second round!

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:57.800
I'm sorry, Luca…  Yusei…

00:21:01.910 --> 00:21:02.860
Lua…

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:04.700
He lost.

00:21:05.710 --> 00:21:06.980
What is it?

00:21:06.980 --> 00:21:09.480
The weird feeling has disappeared.

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:16.450
Well done.

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:18.890
That was a good duel.

00:21:20.730 --> 00:21:22.140
What I heard was wrong.

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:26.500
I heard it was supposed to be a 
girl, but that was clearly a boy.

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:29.660
But we still arrived at a conclusion.

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:32.850
It's getting interesting.

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:37.180
I returned the D-Sensor's output 
to its original settings.

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:39.180
Are you fine with the results?

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:44.710
The signal was clearly pointing to this girl.

00:22:03.850 --> 00:22:09.430
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:14.820
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:20.750
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:25.980
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.170 --> 00:22:29.140
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:31.710 --> 00:22:34.730
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:36.680 --> 00:22:41.890
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:42.020 --> 00:22:47.290
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:53.230
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:53.530 --> 00:22:58.570
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.110 --> 00:23:04.640
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:04.780 --> 00:23:14.050
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
